bodies/ssl_robot: body.py, model.xml (generated by tools/make_model.py) and the tools are original work of this repository, written
from the dimensions published in the RoboCup Small Size League's team description papers (TIGERs Mannheim,
ZJUNlict, KIKS) and rules; they contain no team's CAD data and no third-party model. Released under the
